# devtooltui

Everyday developer utilities in **a single binary**: a TUI and a CLI.

## Install

```bash
go install github.com/Judamaro/devtooltui-golang/cmd/devtooltui@latest
```

- Works offline
- No telemetry
  - Not even a little

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `Ctrl+P` | Palette |
| `?` | Help |

> Inspired by [DevToys](https://github.com/DevToys-app/DevToys).
